_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wDvKu_ij34QQ7kNvwEl1BGs&_nc_oc=AdrXmd1xoJbwmin0xuCtwmvu6AQwUisBuooyRfqt_ByJ5acWtnurEqli17uAQcC-aP4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKIZuNQl3jiuZyrisSTgS1qdxK9KPPgAhVz0j6z-bNTNA&oe=6AB3CC5F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wheelchair Simulator", "keywords": ["wheelchair", "simulator", "mobility", "training", "accessibility"], "long_description": "Learn to drive an electric wheelchair in a safe and immersive environment. Practise at your own pace, with no risks, as many times as you need.\n\nFEATURES\n\n10 progressive levels \u2014 Work through increasingly challenging courses, from simple to complex.\nFreestyle mode \u2014 Explore an open virtual city with no time limit. Roam the streets and discover collectible stars scattered across the city.\nCollision system \u2014 Every bump counts. The simulator detects frontal and rear collisions and lateral slips, helping you drive with more precision and care.\nPerformance tracking \u2014 Each user has their own profile. Every run records time, collisions, and slips, with a full session history to follow your progress.\nConfigurable steering \u2014 Choose between front-wheel and rear-wheel steering.", "short_description": "This simulator provides a safe, immersive environment for practising\nelectric wheelchair driving."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Square.png", "id": "27700176959575396", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_27700176969575395_1128701276142743954_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rT8vCPxwLd8Q7kNvwFo3Z7O&_nc_oc=AdoujLmujHhSd0XnUtqWoFzeTLumFHLl_qJXBErOuz0WX2wNgvPUTHCpzQqinliV0mE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLyr4WA0v0zOafCUa1MFxEHcqW_47L5_7TY45fQD0EncA&oe=6AB3F87B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "1606929641002567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https: